<title>USA: Liquidation World stake held by fund.</title>
<headline>Liquidation World stake held by fund.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivy Enterprise Fund, by its investment adviser Mackenzie Financial Corp, said Wednesday it holds a 5.5 percent stake in Liquidation World Inc or 210,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Ivy said its latest transactions include the purchase of 37,500 common shares on January 23 at a price of $20.25 per share.</p>
<p>The stake is held for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
<p>Liquidation World, based in Calgary, Alberta, is a liquidator of close-out merchandise by retail and auction.</p>
</text>
